reconfigure.description:
Amber now reports different metering channels for this site.

New: {added}
No longer reported: {removed}

New channels get statistics from the next day to be imported. Statistics of channels that are no longer reported are kept, but no longer updated.

legacy_cleanup.description:
The migration is complete. Remove these leftovers of the YAML kit when you are satisfied:

{items}

This notice only lists them; nothing here is removed automatically. It is re-checked after each scheduled run and when Home Assistant starts, and clears itself once they are all gone. The old statistics are kept until you delete them with the delete_legacy_statistics action; see the migration guide.
